Title:
[Process Doc Update]: README for OctoAcme Project Management Docs — README, project management processes summary, and links

Body:
This PR adds docs/README.md: a single-page index and concise summary of OctoAcme's project management process documents. The README provides a short overview of the process, key workflows, personas and communication cadence, QA and release guidance, and an index of the detailed docs in docs/.

Closes #2

Files changed:
- docs/README.md (new)

Notes for reviewers:
